RULE "Transport capability should be broad and simple; authority is enforced at the actual protected action boundary."
RULE "A newer verified pending update supersedes older pending metadata by archiving it rather than silently deleting history."
FACT operational_memory="SQLite-primary protected var/db/kicom.sqlite"
FACT sqlite_mode="WAL, foreign_keys ON, busy_timeout 5000, synchronous NORMAL"
FACT sqlite_compatibility="legacy JSON/JSONL retained as dual-write and rebuild mirrors"
FACT sqlite_healing="quick_check, integrity_check, snapshots, quarantine, restore and mirror rebuild"
FACT sqlite_evolution="shadow DB, measured fitness, integrity gate, transactional promotion, snapshots"
FACT sqlite_boundaries="Canonical KCL, Genome, secrets and immutable archive authority stay outside SQLite"
RULE "SQLite is primary operational memory, not the sole root of trust."
END_PROJECT kicom
